				<title>SCP-5978</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5978</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.velvetblues.com/wp-content/uploads/hourglass.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot; alt=&quot;hourglass.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Object in its Containment Chamber, placed in the middle of a brown wooden table&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5978&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5978 is to be kept in a steel containment chamber, and placed in the exact middle of a brown wooden table. The steel chamber must include thick padding on the walls, to prevent SCP-5978&#039;s anomalous effects. Personnel of Level 4 or higher are granted access to the containment chamber. Personnel recontaining SCP-5978 are not to travel more than 1 foot every second, doing so will result in hallucinations and paranormal activity in persons within a 100 foot radius.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5978 is a hourglass, standing 9.5 inches tall and has a 6-inch base. Around the glass, consists of golden swirly bars that protect the hourglass from breaking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any and all humans who come into contact with, physically touch, remain around, or until all sand grains reach the bottom of SCP-5978, will begin experiencing hallucinations, and paranormal activity. Shortly after, persons will begin to feel the urge to break the hourglass. Upon that effect, the human is now designated &#039;SCP-5978-A&#039;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the attempt to break SCP-5978 by SCP-5978-A is successful, two events have a possibility of occurring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event #1:&lt;/strong&gt; The sands of time will stop immediately after the breakage of SCP-5978, freezing the universe entirely. Any attempts to revert this have not been made, as it is not possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event #2:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5978-A will have full control over the sands of time upon breakage of SCP-5978. Any events upon their request will be made.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5977&quot;&gt;SCP-5977&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5978 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5979&quot;&gt;SCP-5979&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-clovin&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7184380&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609559506&quot; alt=&quot;Agent Clovin&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7184380)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-clovin&quot;  &gt;Agent Clovin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
