o that of a poison dart frog</p> <p>Images product of Hancocks.co.uk</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6628226&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609559506" alt="mr intertab" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6628226)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab" >mr intertab</a></span></p> 
