&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt;SCP-5368&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5368 must be contained in a 12x6 room with a large glass window for distant inspections. When inspecting SCP-5368 from inside the chamber, please wear gloves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5368, otherwise known as The Gun, The gun is a Mauser M1887 the gun was made for ww1, country of origin Germany we believe it was made by Königliche Waffen Schmieden in 1918 but we have no proof of this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5368 was found in a Trench November 11, 1918 By Major Paul Muller When the gun was found it was displaying anomalous properties Such as levitation but no other signs, and the gun was taken for further study, When it was taken a ceasefire was broken immediately, now its held in a 12x6 room on a pedestal When there&#039;s a Fight at site 19 the gun will start to float and the fighting will stop and continue after a random amount of time or if it is disturbed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;image-container alignright&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.militaryrifles.com/Turkey/TurkMaus01.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;TurkMaus01.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7166385&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609559506&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Blau&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7166385)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau&quot;  &gt;Dr Blau&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 31 Dec 2020 19:59:14 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <hr /> <p><strong>Item #:</strong>SCP-5368</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Safe</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5368 must be contained in a 12x6 room with a large glass window for distant inspections. When inspecting SCP-5368 from inside the chamber, please wear gloves.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5368, otherwise known as The Gun, The gun is a Mauser M1887 the gun was made for ww1, country of origin Germany we believe it was made by Königliche Waffen Schmieden in 1918 but we have no proof of this.</p> <p><strong>Addendum:</strong></p> <p>SCP-5368 was found in a Trench November 11, 1918 By Major Paul Muller When the gun was found it was displaying anomalous properties Such as levitation but no other signs, and the gun was taken for further study, When it was taken a ceasefire was broken immediately, now its held in a 12x6 room on a pedestal When there's a Fight at site 19 the gun will start to float and the fighting will stop and continue after a random amount of time or if it is disturbed.</p> <div class="image-container alignright"><img src="http://www.militaryrifles.com/Turkey/TurkMaus01.jpg" alt="TurkMaus01.jpg" class="image" /></div> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7166385&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609559506" alt="Dr Blau" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7166385)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blau" >Dr Blau</a></span></p> 
